
                      DayDream BBS V1.00, Security.DAT
                      --------------------------------

OFFSET  TYPE     LENGTH  DESCRIPTION                                     FLAGS
==============================================================================
 0000   BYTE       01    SECURITY LEVEL                                    (-)
 0001   BYTE       01    FILE RATIO (UL:DL <> 1:VALUE)                     (-)
 0002   BYTE       01    BYTE RATIO (UL:DL <> 1:VALUE)                     (-)
 0003   BYTE       01    UNUSED                                            (-)
 0004   WORD	   01    DAILY TIME LIMIT IN MINUTES                       (-)
 0006   LONG WORD  04    CONFERENCE ACCESS INDICATOR #1:01-32              (-)
 0010   LONG WORD  04    CONFERENCE ACCESS INDICATOR #1:33-64              (-)
 0014   LONG WORD  04    ACCESS BITS #1                                    (-)
 0018   LONG WORD  04    ACCESS BITS #2                                    (-)
 0022   LONG WORD  04    ACCESS BITS #3                                    (-)
 0026   LONG WORD  04    ACCESS BITS #4                                    (-)
 0030   FREE BLOCK 20    FREE SPACE RESERVED ETC                           (-)
==============================================================================

