02  READ MESSAGES                     03  ENTER MESSAGE
04  PAGE SYSOP                        05  LEAVE COMMENT
06  READ BULLETINS                    07  VIEW FILE DIRECTORIES
08  VIEW NEW FILES                    09  ZIPPY SEARCH
10  RUN DOOR                          11  JOIN CONFERENCE
12  CHANGE MSG AREA                   13  CHANGE PERSONAL INFO
14  RELOGIN                           15  TAG EDITOR
16  VIEW USER STATS                   17  VIEW TIME
18  HYDRA TRANSFER                    19  EXPERTMODE CHANGE
20  EALL MESSAGE                      21  FIDONET MESSAGE
22  SEND PRIVATE MESSAGE              23  READ ALL PRIVATE MESSAGES
24  USER EDITOR                       25  VIEW LOGFILE
26  SYSOP DOWNLOAD                    27  USERLIST
28  DELETE ANY MESSAGE                29  REMOTE SHELL
30  WHO                               31  MOVE FILE
